arrival_call = "This is your second shift. The planets in this system are full of business passengers. They are a bit picky, but they have [money]money[/money]. [shout]I want that money.[/shout] Again, we track everything you do. Do. Not. Fail."
promotion_call = "We are rich! No, [shout]I'm rich![/shout] Your statistics are the best of any resource in eons. I want you in the system called Sol. We have something very important to do."
